{"data": [{"author_id": "304504527", "created_at": "2026-10-31T23:55:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116680515914977634"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/cleoabram/stat…", "end": 110, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/cleoabram/status/2116587096651505814", "start": 87, "url": "https://t.co/Bi4gAl3tTI"}]}, "id": "2116680515914977634", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 115, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116587096651505814", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "这个视频展示了马斯克旗下的Neuralink 公司的脑机接口是如何运作的，怎么样被植入大脑，以及能够做什么。\n\n其他的做脑机接口的公司也不少，但是从来没有过这样的科普视频。 https://t.co/Bi4gAl3tTI", "url": "https://x.com/newfat2001/status/2116680515914977634"}, {"author_id": "1739643782768021504", "created_at": "2026-10-31T22:16:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116655672263843903"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/PNMbORRbNj", "end": 176, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/ppmmzzcn/status/2116655672263843903/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116655657344737280", "start": 153, "url": "https://t.co/PNMbORRbNj"}]}, "id": "2116655672263843903", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 58, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "💻【IT之家】马斯克公布 Neuralink 脑机新产品进展：第二款产品“盲视”只待监管批准\n\n10月30日，马斯克在 X 上连续发布三条推文。第一条谈「心灵感应」（Telepathy）：未来人们可以仅凭思考与电脑甚至其他人高速交流，脑机接口的输出速度几年内将远超人类说话和打字。特斯拉首席执行官埃隆 · https://t.co/PNMbORRbNj", "url": "https://x.com/ppmmzzcn/status/2116655672263843903"}, {"author_id": "1769051162169561089", "created_at": "2026-10-31T22:40:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116661697264210002"], "id": "2116661697264210002", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 21, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "脑机接口的新闻又刷屏了。比起\"意念打字\"的炫技，我更关心它十年后怎么帮渐冻症患者重新说话。技术的浪漫，最终都要落到具体的人身上才算数。", "url": "https://x.com/hajiMVP/status/2116661697264210002"}, {"author_id": "1423125810261725187", "created_at": "2026-10-31T23:44:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116677637905190976"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/elonmusk/statu…", "end": 108, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/elonmusk/status/2116614579136635120", "start": 85, "url": "https://t.co/5Fnz2LluLe"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/lRnpLXRCFW", "end": 132, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/chuanda17/status/2116677637905190976/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116677607009681408", "start": 109, "url": "https://t.co/lRnpLXRCFW"}]}, "id": "2116677637905190976", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116614579136635120", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "马斯克转发 Cleo Abram 探访 Neuralink 的深度片，称「Neuralink deep dive」——片中近距离看新款 R1 手术机器人与脑机接口进展。\nhttps://t.co/5Fnz2LluLe https://t.co/lRnpLXRCFW", "url": "https://x.com/chuanda17/status/2116677637905190976"}, {"author_id": "1508657929221980172", "created_at": "2026-10-31T21:07:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116638335112503612"], "id": "2116638335112503612", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 359, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "脑机接口正在帮失声的人重新开口～\n\nALS、帕金森、脑损伤患者，靠植入设备把脑信号转成语言。以前他们只能眨眼、动手指，现在能直接“说”出来～", "url": "https://x.com/maxiaohui66/status/2116638335112503612"}, {"author_id": "1995094158185541632", "created_at": "2026-11-01T00:24:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116687899215155358"], "id": "2116687899215155358", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 185, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I am big on individualism but BCI enabled hiveminds would awesome for a variety of reasons.", "url": "https://x.com/__0xhorror__/status/2116687899215155358"}, {"author_id": "1863510095914512384", "created_at": "2026-10-31T22:56:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116665605189431528"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 174, "start": 170, "tag": "BCI"}, {"end": 189, "start": 175, "tag": "BuildInPublic"}], "urls": [{"description": "Painstakingly patch together a headset… for science!", "display_url": "abstergollc.org/abstergo-blog/…", "end": 169, "expanded_url": "https://abstergollc.org/abstergo-blog/build-yer-own-eeg", "images": [{"height": 1024, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116665626022596608/WWAInyhG?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1024}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116665626022596608/WWAInyhG?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 146, "status": 200, "title": "Build Yer Own EEG — Abstergo LLC", "unwound_url": "https://www.abstergollc.org/abstergo-blog/build-yer-own-eeg", "url": "https://t.co/fyLOPxXYrg"}]}, "id": "2116665605189431528", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "The brain speaks in quiet electricity. Build Yer Own EEG lists the parts to listen — cap, processor, Ag/AgCl pellets — no surgery, just patience. https://t.co/fyLOPxXYrg #BCI #BuildInPublic", "url": "https://x.com/abstergo_media/status/2116665605189431528"}, {"author_id": "1978227370684452864", "created_at": "2026-10-31T21:54:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116649929326395748"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 21, "id": "895332160130891776", "start": 11, "username": "neuralink"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/neuralink/stat…", "end": 175, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/neuralink/status/2115878416423784939", "start": 152, "url": "https://t.co/N1rBBFpM25"}]}, "id": "2116649929326395748", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 42, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115878416423784939", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "The recent @neuralink news opens up so many possibilities for BCI-type applications?\n\nRai