us/2116660242285232634"}, {"author_id": "1503", "created_at": "2026-10-31T21:21:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116641837352206458"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/cleoabram/stat…", "end": 108, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/cleoabram/status/2116587096651505814", "start": 85, "url": "https://t.co/VMMYm5LUas"}]}, "id": "2116641837352206458", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 89, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116587096651505814", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "amazing times: bci on one end humanoid robotics on the other. \n\nfusion will be wild! https://t.co/VMMYm5LUas", "url": "https://x.com/brij/status/2116641837352206458"}, {"author_id": "1694778622022688769", "created_at": "2026-10-31T22:33:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116659794840781045"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/z0dDGXrHjm", "end": 301, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/dlcampbell05/status/2116659794840781045/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116659759805771776", "start": 278, "url": "https://t.co/z0dDGXrHjm"}]}, "id": "2116659794840781045", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 83, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Wow. A man who lost his ability to speak is making phone calls again, and the words are coming from a chip in his brain.\n\nAccording to a Neuralink post on Thursday, its engineers spent 72 hours at the home of a participant in VOICE, the company’s speech implant study, building https://t.co/z0dDGXrHjm", "url": "https://x.com/dlcampbell05/status/2116659794840781045"}, {"author_id": "1830017110346436608", "created_at": "2026-10-31T21:42:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116646901386973570"], "id": "2116646901386973570", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 2012, "like_count": 9, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "شاغر مهندس صيانة ميكانيكية\n\nالجهة: مجموعة BCI.\n\nالمقر: مصنع الجبيل.\n\nالمتطلبات:\n- بكالوريوس في الهندسة الميكانيكية أو تخصص ذي صلة.\n- خبرة في بيئة مصانع التصنيع أو المصانع الكيميائية أو الصناعية.\n- مهارات قوية في حل المشكلات والتحليل والتواصل.\n- إجادة اللغة الإنجليزية.\n\nالمهام", "url": "https://x.com/bksa0_/status/2116646901386973570"}, {"author_id": "1929209713331437568", "created_at": "2026-10-31T21:21:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116641625942454630"], "id": "2116641625942454630", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 12, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "11/1(日)朝5時45分から6時13分にしらぬ間の、同意なし、見えないところで勝手に施したスマート医療BCIに右瞼の筋にBMI-FESで電極ではなく通信で不正侵入して攻撃してくる。広島大学病院また研究所を警察組織は速く検挙しろ。政治、在日の圧力で動けないのか。\n住田明香の父は何者だ皆怖い人って並べる", "url": "https://x.com/slO93X1rlC53348/status/2116641625942454630"}, {"author_id": "1929209713331437568", "created_at": "2026-10-31T21:27:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116643323754799238"], "id": "2116643323754799238", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "先程、住田の父親の投稿で脳ハッキングAIの広島市役所の岡田知子はスマート医療BCIテロのデジタル音声送信で「あぁ、そんなこと書いたら殺される」と送信してくる。広島大学病院のムーンショット計画の知らぬ間同意なく見えない所で勝手に脳思考を解析するAI付けられた国家安全保証を侵害は在日からだ", "url": "https://x.com/slO93X1rlC53348/status/2116643323754799238"}, {"author_id": "710253247324299264", "created_at": "2026-10-31T23:37:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116675883788603776"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 59, "id": "895332160130891776", "start": 49, "username": "neuralink"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/tnBNzjWwi2", "end": 304, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/liangsays/status/2116675883788603776/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116673474660093952", "start": 281, "url": "https://t.co/tnBNzjWwi2"}, {"display_url": "x.com/Cyborg21/statu…", "end": 328, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/Cyborg21/status/2116661252256846097", "start": 305, "url": "https://t.co/q23a82GKgQ"}]}, "id": "2116675883788603776", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 4484, "like_count": 43, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 2}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116661252256846097", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "moments like this mean so much to us\n\nkenneth is @neuralink's 21th patient. we were inspired by his story and covered it on the stream: kenneth lost his ability to speak 4+ years ago due to als. neuralink engineers spent 72 hours at his home, now he can answer his own phone calls https://t.co/tnBNzjWwi2 https://t.co/q23a82GKgQ", "url": "https://x.com/liangsays/status/2116675883788603776"}, {"author_id": "2098802836955885572", "created_at": "2026-11-01T00:07:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116683602377298406"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/ny9gH6A4ku", "end": 295, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Rhoxbt/status/2116683602377298406/video/1", "media_key": "13_2116677650555039744", "start": 272, "url": "https://t.co/ny9gH6A4ku"}, {"display_url": "x.com/0xCodila/statu…", "end": 319, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/0xCodila/status/2100984487802708306", "start": 296, "url": "https://t.co/3tRG5O9sCk"}]}, "id": "2116683602377298406", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 67, "impression_count": 4568, "like_count": 90, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 17}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2100984487802708306", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "WHOEVER LEAKED THIS JEV BRAIN SCAN DESERVES THE BCI CHAIR\n\nI thought a brain scan was one grayscale picture, two findings, and a bill from your HMO.\n\nApparently not.\n\nThis scan's setup is much more interesting:\n\n→ ANATOMY splits the volume across 6 regions (frontal 12.3, https://t.co/ny9gH6A4ku https://t.co/3tRG5O9sCk", "url": "https://x.com/Rhoxbt/status/2116683602377298406"}, {"author_id": "1775262835234500609", "created_at": "2026-10-31T23:25:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116672852329996648"], "id": "21